  "tutorial1Title": "Welcome to Carcassonne Counter!",
  "tutorial1Body": "A score counter for Carcassonne that supports expansions. A few steps will show you how to use it.",
  "tutorial2Title": "Add players",
  "tutorial2Body": "Use the \"+\" button to add players (at least two are needed) and pick their meeple colors. Press and hold a player row to edit or delete it. Turn on the expansions you play with in the menu: Expansions.",
  "tutorial3Title": "Start the game",
  "tutorial3Body": "When everything is ready, press \"Start game\". From then on you cannot change players or expansions.",
  "tutorial4Title": "Add points",
  "tutorial4Body": "Tap a player row, choose what you are scoring (city, road, cloister, farm or an expansion element), enter the result and confirm.",
  "tutorial5Title": "A mistake?",
  "tutorial5Body": "In the menu you can undo the last event. The rules summary reminds you what everything is worth, and the \"?\" next to elements tells you what to do.",
  "tutorial6Title": "End of the game",
  "tutorial6Body": "The flag button ends the game. You will see the winner and a summary of the points from each source. Have fun!",
  "aboutTitle": "About the app",
  "aboutVersion": "Version {version}",
  "aboutDescription": "A score counter for the Carcassonne board game. It scores by the rules, supports many expansions, guides the game flow and shows a summary at the end.",
